Applied to triton-ext 1afa671b (head of triton-ext#142) by
docker/rocm-triton-ext.Dockerfile.

The PR targets Triton main, where AsyncCopyGlobalToLocalOp takes a cachePolicy
attribute. On release/3.8 the op takes cache/evict/isVolatile/contiguity
instead, and their defaults are what the PR passes on main.

